  "notes": "{越|こ}える is an ichidan verb meaning to cross over or exceed.\n\nWRITING:\n- {越|こ}える: to cross (physical), to exceed\n- {超|こ}える: to surpass, transcend (more abstract)\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {越|こ}える (ichidan): to cross over\n- ⟦{越|こ}す→越す：02282_kosu⟧ (godan): to pass, to move past\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}える: to cross a mountain\n- ⟦{国境|こっきょう}→国境：02762_kokkyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}える: to cross a border\n- ⟦{予算|よさん}→予算：03663_yosan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}える: to exceed the budget\n- ⟦{限界|げんかい}→限界：02715_genkai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{超|こ}える: to exceed limits\n\nFIGURATIVE:\n⟦{壁|かべ}→壁：01290_kabe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{越|こ}える can mean overcoming obstacles.",
